-> full_run_gate NO-GO. Two separate blockers documented: (a) SCIENCE -- the ARC oracle-distinct
win hardened only within-pool, cross-game OOD blocked, so the gate stays NO-GO until cross-game
generalization holds regardless of runtime; (b) WRONG-LOADER -- the conductor's preflight used a
standard GGUF loader, but the diffusion-gemma arch is only runnable by the llama.cpp PR #24423
binary llama-diffusion-gemma-eval (which already extracts the energy-prior), NOT llama-cpp-python
0.3.29 / transformers / vLLM. Points the .395 preflight at the working binary so the runtime
blocker stops recurring. Detector aside: diffusion-surprisal is a weak (length-confounded) error
detector; the energy-prior is for guidance, not headline detection.

